  "publishedAt": "2026-07-27T19:58:22.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp\" data-main-content-parent=\"true\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tc6\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tc6/comp-mox40tc82/comp-mox425ay/comp-mox425b7/comp-mox425eo/comp-mox425eq2/comp-mox425md\"><p id=\"comp-mox425md\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h2>Unlocking resilience<br>\nfor the chemical industry</h2></p></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\" id=\"comp-mox40tcd\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox428gy\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox428j0\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h2><span>Chemical production is <span>centralized</span> and <span>fossil fuel- dependent</span>, making it vulnerable to geopolitical events and natural disasters</span></h2></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox71elr\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h2><span><span>Biogas</span> is the ideal domestic feedstock: the U.S. produces enough biogas to make <span>over $20 billion <span>worth of chemicals annually</span></span>, but 60% is wasted or flared in low-margin applications</span></h2></p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mox8nvsf\" id=\"comp-mox8nvsf\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mox8nvsf\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mox8nvsf&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;middle east refinery.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_b4dab6d142b543b593694eb8f2141f14~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1632,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp5w9h4q&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;middle east refinery.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a5m-4947&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:0,&quot;width&quot;:2819,&quot;height&quot;:1631},&quot;width&quot;:2912,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_b4dab6d142b543b593694eb8f2141f14~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_2819,h_1631/fill/w_2819,h_1631,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_b4dab6d142b543b593694eb8f2141f14~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mox8nvsf\"><picture><img alt=\"middle east refinery.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mox8obsw\" id=\"comp-mox8obsw\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mox8obsw\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mox8obsw&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;evreka.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_8228c77dd0c54cfd8b75489afa1fe258~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1705,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp5qat7n&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;evreka.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a5m-2050&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:0,&quot;y&quot;:87,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1450},&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_8228c77dd0c54cfd8b75489afa1fe258~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_87,w_2560,h_1450/fill/w_2560,h_1450,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_8228c77dd0c54cfd8b75489afa1fe258~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mox8obsw\"><picture><img alt=\"evreka.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\" id=\"comp-mox6vjmq\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox8wbvg\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h2>We convert stranded biogas from wastewater plants, farms, and landfills on-site into valuable chemicals like dimethyl ether (DME), methanol, and dimethyl carbonate (DMC)</h2></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox40tcj\" data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mp5nviye\"><div id=\"comp-mp5nviye\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mp5nvizz3\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h5><span>Supply-Secure</span></h5></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>We convert domestic raw biogas into chemicals, removing the reliance on fossil fuels and vulnerable supply chains.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gohk5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gohk5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox6goi31\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h5><span>Modular</span></h5></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our technology fits inside a shipping container, allowing for rapid and in-situ deployment, quicker payback, streamlined permitting, and access to the cheapest biogas.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6goim6\"><div id=\"comp-mox6goim6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox6goj43\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h5><span>Scalable</span></h5></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>We can scale with your facility, easily adding or subtracting modules, ensuring long-term financial growth.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gogg5\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gogg5\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox6goh03\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h5><span>Price Competitive</span></h5></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our proprietary process enables us to produce DME that competes pricewise with petrochemical DME and the cheapest green methanol &amp; DMC available.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mox40tcj/comp-mox40tcl4/comp-mox6goeq/comp-mox6goeu6/comp-mox6gof83\"><div id=\"comp-mox6gof83\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mox6gofp3\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p id=\"comp-mox6goft3\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><h5><span>Low-Carbon</span></h5></p><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>Our modules utilize waste gases to produce chemicals without the extraction, processing, and transportation of fossil fuels as raw materials.</p><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-testid=\"section-container\" role=\"group\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwau\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"Section\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbf\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mrc7xiia\"><div id=\"comp-mrc7xiia\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>Pilot&nbsp;container has arrived at our host site (Chicagoland wastewater plant), officially kicking off construction.</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>July 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mrc7xiot\" id=\"comp-mrc7xiot\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mrc7xiot\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mrc7xiot&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1300,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mrc833ci&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;module shot website.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;nlc-1543&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:1300,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1300,h_1300,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/f82708_c78bd5e8d3094257a3c13e93180853fe~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mrc7xiot\"><picture><img alt=\"module shot website.jpg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mpe5fvzh\"><div id=\"comp-mpe5fvzh\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p>Rise Reforming joins Y Combinator’s S26 batch to accelerate scale-up and time to market.</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><p>May 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mpe5fw5y\" id=\"comp-mpe5fw5y\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mpe5fw5y\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mpe5fw5y&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:500,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mpe5iu2b&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;a4x-718&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:502,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_502,h_500,al_c,q_85,enc_auto/4e3194_180678d2f2894ec3831aab4f51df7b16~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mpe5fw5y\"><picture><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-18 at 1.13.44 PM.png\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwbo\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwbo\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><p><span>Signed a binding supply agreement and multiple MOUs with biogas producers. Signed a conditional DME offtake agreement for our first commercial unit.</span></p><!--/$--><!--$--><p>April 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp2ykwc6\"><div id=\"comp-mp2ykwc6\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp341znm\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote><span>Proof-of-concept complete after 1800+ hours of stable syngas production. Next, with pilot plant designs ready, we're taking our technology to live biogas.</span></blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>March 2026</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp2ykwcj\" id=\"comp-mp2ykwcj\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp2ykwcj\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp2ykwcj&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:2868,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp35asmt&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;IIT_lab.jpeg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;jps-19379&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;crop&quot;:{&quot;x&quot;:67,&quot;y&quot;:92,&quot;width&quot;:2318,&quot;height&quot;:2127},&quot;width&quot;:3024,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg/v1/crop/x_67,y_92,w_2318,h_2127/fill/w_2318,h_2127,al_c,q_90,enc_auto/4e3194_63587d5b8f194f13a890ef9bbdadc9db~mv2.jpeg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}\" data-motion-part=\"BG_IMG comp-mp2ykwcj\"><picture><img alt=\"IIT_lab.jpeg\"></picture></wow-image></div><!--/$--></div></interact-element><!--/$--><!--$--><interact-element data-interact-key=\"c1dmp/Containerc1dmp/PAGE_SECTIONSc1dmp/comp-mp2ykwau/comp-mp2ykwbd/comp-mp2ykwbf/comp-mp2ykwbg1/comp-mp5qj7dm\"><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7dm\" data-testid=\"internal-container-root\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mp5qj7eb3\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><blockquote><span>Pre-seed round of funding closed ($650k) towards completing proof-of-concept, filing process IP, and finalizing our plans for the pilot plant.</span></blockquote></div><!--/$--><!--$--><p>December 2025</p><!--/$--><!--$--><div data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-mp5qj7ep\" id=\"comp-mp5qj7ep\"><wow-image id=\"img-comp-mp5qj7ep\" data-image-info=\"{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mp5qj7ep&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;4e3194_122e8c866f05401bbfbfbc5a4368fe4c~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:920,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mp5rv7es&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;FirstStep.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&qu